sdiv25: x / 25, for x from -999 to 999, truncated toward zero. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-14, with x in cell 90.
Copy cells 10-14 to where the program needs x / 25, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x; the program goes on with x / 25 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator; x is kept.
Size 5 cells. It runs 5 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-14: 4x / 100
 11     290      ADD 90
 12     290      ADD 90
 13     290      ADD 90
 14     402      SFT 02
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
